<title>BRAZIL: Banco do Brasil trading to resume Friday.</title>
<headline>Banco do Brasil trading to resume Friday.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade in Brazilian federal bank Banco do Brasil will resume Friday on the stock exchanges after the bank announced a 7.52 billion reais loss in 1996, a bank spokesman said.</p>
<p>Trade of Banco do Brasil's shares was suspended today following a request from the bank as it would release the figures.</p>
<p>On Wednesday, Banco do Brasil preferred traded at 10 reais on the Sao Paulo Stock Exchange (Bovespa).</p>
<p>((--Fatima Cristina, Rio de Janeiro Newsroom 5521 5074151))</p>
